		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><a href="#TOC001">Table of Contents</a></p>


	<div class="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<p class="H1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">FREIGHTCAR AMERICA, INC.</span></p>
		<p class="H2" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:0;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">125 South Wacker Drive, Suite 1500</span></p>
		<p class="H2" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:0;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Chicago, Illinois 60606</span></p>
		<p class="H1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">NOTICE OF ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS</span></p>
		<p class="H2" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:0;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">To be held on April&#160;10, 2026</span></p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">March&#160;19, 2026</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Dear FreightCar America Stockholder:</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">We are notifying you that the Annual Meeting of Stockholders of FreightCar America, Inc. will be held at 10:00&#160;a.m. (Central Time) on April&#160;10, 2026 (the &#8220;Annual Meeting&#8221;). The Annual Meeting will be held in virtual format only, via live webcast on the Internet, with no physical, in<span class="nobreak">-person</span> meeting. You will be able to attend and participate in the Annual Meeting online by visiting <span class="CharOverride-4" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">www.meetnow.global/MFVJ6LW</span> where you will be able to listen to the meeting live, submit questions and vote. We recommend that you log in a few minutes before the meeting to ensure that you are logged in when the meeting starts. The Annual Meeting is being held for the purposes set forth below and such other business as may properly come before the meeting or any adjournment thereof.</p>
		<p class="NL_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">1.<span style="width: 20px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>To elect three directors as Class&#160;III directors, each for a term of three&#160;years.</p>
		<p class="NL_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">2.<span style="width: 20px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>To hold an advisory vote to approve the compensation of our Named Executive Officers as named in the enclosed proxy statement.</p>
		<p class="NL_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:48pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">3.<span style="width: 20px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>To ratify the appointment of Grant Thornton LLP as our independent registered public accounting firm for fiscal year 2026.</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">On or about March&#160;19, 2026, we will make available to our stockholders copies of the enclosed proxy statement (the &#8220;Proxy Statement&#8221;) and Annual Report on Form&#160;10<span class="nobreak">-K</span> for the year ended December&#160;31, 2025 (the &#8220;Annual Report&#8221;). Stockholders should review all proxy materials before voting. Only stockholders of record at the close of business on February&#160;10, 2026 are entitled to vote at the Annual Meeting and any postponements or adjournments of the meeting. A complete list of these stockholders will be available at our principal executive offices prior to the Annual Meeting. Each of the matters listed above is described in further detail in the enclosed proxy statement.</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Whether or not you plan to attend the Annual Meeting, please be sure to vote your shares in accordance with the instructions on the enclosed proxy card as promptly as possible. You can withdraw your proxy at any time before it is voted.</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">By order of the Board of Directors,</p>
		<table class="No-Table-Style" style="width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px solid #000; border-width: 0pt; margin: 10pt 0 10pt 0;">


				<tr class="No-Table-Style _idGenTableRowColumn-4" style="height:12pt;">
					<td class="TB" style="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;width: 41.90%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;border-bottom: windowtext 1pt none; border-bottom-style: solid;" valign="bottom">



						<p class="Signature_rule" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;"><span class="CharOverride-4" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">/s/ Nicholas J.&#160;Randall</span></p>
					</td>
					<td class="TB" style="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width: 1.28%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;white-space: nowrap;" valign="bottom">&#160;</td>
